:: D1_Circular [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--violet">ВХ. № 3311 · 12.08.91</span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">ЦК КПСС · Общий отдел</span><span class="doc-sub">Circular · for internal use</span></div>
<div class="doc-meta"><span>№ 112-ц</span><span>09.08.1991</span><span>Copy 14 of 40</span></div>
<p class="doc-title">On the procedure for registering correspondence during the summer leave period</p>

1. During the leave period (August), all incoming correspondence is to be registered on the day of receipt without exception.

2. Documents marked <<ru "sekretno" "СЕКРЕТНО">> are to be entered in the restricted section of the <<ru "kartoteka">> and issued against signature only.

3. Deliveries <<ru "narochnym">> (by courier) are to be registered in the general manner, and the courier's name recorded.

4. Heads of sectors will ensure that the duty officer's telephone is answered at all times.

<p class="doc-sign">Head of the General Department<br>(signature)</p>
<div class="doc-footer"><em>Fictional document created for this game.</em> Point 3 matters: under the rules, nothing delivered by courier may bypass the registry.</div>
<<returnlink>>
</div>


